author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Standard single-item reads try brief before string or row compaction and disclose the retained depth and reason; emitted estimated_tokens remains exact for rendering and session accounting while omitted_result_estimated_tokens reports the useful result size on refusal; every active item reads successfully at the default budget and a brief-too-large negative control refuses; the regression preserves a 2700-character description and 26 dependencies without mutation.
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: Try the declared brief projection before lossy compaction; disclose applied depth and omitted sections while preserving explicit projections and exact emitted/session costs.
expected_result: Default rich item reads retain useful complete metadata within budget; oversized brief results still refuse with a useful-result cost estimate.
actual_result: All 311 active records return successfully; five brief fallbacks fit at at most 5959 JSON tokens. Negative controls and all 8890 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; linked regression passed.
