  "2026-09-15T10:40:33.474Z","harness:codex",CodeRabbit PR #1260 correctly noted the generated Fixed entry repeated the old defect. Updated this item title through pm to describe the delivered brief fallback and explicit omission receipts; the original defect description and immutable history are preserved. CHANGELOG remains package-generated.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-15T09:24:16.169Z","harness:codex",Budget fallback must preserve projection semantics and measure its own recovery disclosure. Use executable field selectors for omitted groups; retrying the same standard depth alone can repeat the fallback. Keep emitted-envelope token accounting distinct from omitted-result estimates to preserve session charging.
